      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARLEM RIPPLE (1) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 366m behind Tip Toe Flow (20.63) in a Maiden. The form out of last race has been strong. Can bounce back. ALMIGHTY ZEUS (2) held a forward position from the pinch but began to paddle on the bend and drifted out of the finish when 7th at this track in Maiden company. Likely to be about the mark. MANGO BEACH (8) is overdue for a maiden success having placed at six of 22 starts, the latest missing the frame when fourth at Q Straight. Gave a big sight last time racing on speed much of the way. One of the main contenders. BYE BRUNETTE (3) warrants respect although new to this track.",
